~ cutscene
Alastor : Ambient magic seems more powerful here. 
Elliot : Too powerful.
Alastor : I fail to see the harm.
Elliot : The deeper we descend, the more uncontrollable spells become. At best they collapse. At worst, they amplify. I was with a team here long before. We had to retreat after one fool smashed his head on the ceiling, trying to fly.
Alastor : I begin to see how this place can be the source of the Rot.
Elliot : We will find our answer deeper.
=> END